# Agent skills.
#
# The set at the repository root is committed on purpose: it pins the guidance
# this project is built to, so the standards cannot drift between machines, and
# design-spec.md names the Web Interface Guidelines as its authority.
#
# Skills a package installs into its own folder are install output. Prisma
# rewrites packages/db/.agents on every pnpm install, so those are ignored.
.claude/
skills-lock.json
apps/*/.agents/
packages/*/.agents/

# Measurement output: regenerated by `pnpm quality:*`.
quality/reports/
.lighthouseci/
